WEBVTT

00:00.133 --> 00:03.913
Five clients. Five Claude accounts. One sign-in at a time.

00:04.200 --> 00:05.200
Meet Hatstand.

00:06.533 --> 00:10.313
Every client gets its own Claude, all signed in, side by side.

00:11.533 --> 00:13.793
Jump between them with a click, or a shortcut.

00:15.067 --> 00:17.497
On a Mac, your pets tell you when Claude needs you.

00:18.533 --> 00:20.833
And every client keeps its own second brain.

00:22.200 --> 00:25.290
Hatstand. Free and open source, for Mac and Windows.
